{
  "name": "Omnichannel Short-Form Content Publishing Engine (NLP Powered)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "create-omnichannel-video",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "responseData": "allEntries",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-trigger",
      "name": "Webhook Intake (Social Feed/Reddit/Trends)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [160, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022",
        "prompt": "=You are an expert NLP Sentiment & Trend Analyst specializing in short-form virality algorithms.\n\nAnalyze the following raw scraped social text / topic:\n\"{{$json.body.raw_feed || $json.body.topic}}\"\n\nPerform these NLP tasks:\n1. Sentiment & Frustration Mining: Extract the core emotional friction, acute problem, or unresolved controversy.\n2. Key Entity & Intent Extraction: Identify the primary high-value keywords and audience intent (e.g., save money, save time, avoid scam).\n3. Viral Trigger Classification: Categorize into one of ['Pattern Interrupt', 'Contrarian Truth', 'Secret Advantage', 'Fear of Missing Out'].\n4. Target Angle: Formulate the single sharpest thesis statement to hook viewers in under 3 seconds.\n\nReturn strict JSON with keys:\n{\n  \"core_frustration\": \"...\",\n  \"keywords\": [\"...\"],\n  \"viral_trigger\": \"...\",\n  \"thesis_angle\": \"...\",\n  \"emotional_valence\": \"high_friction\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3,
          "maxTokens": 800
        }
      },
      "id": "nlp-sentiment-analyzer",
      "name": "NLP Frustration & Trend Analyzer",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [380, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022",
        "prompt": "=You are an elite short-form retention copywriter.\n\nUse this NLP Intelligence input:\n- Core Frustration: {{$json.core_frustration}}\n- Target Angle: {{$json.thesis_angle}}\n- Viral Trigger: {{$json.viral_trigger}}\n- Keywords: {{$json.keywords.join(', ')}}\n\nDraft a 45-second omnichannel video package.\n\nStrict Rules:\n1. Hook: Under 8 words. No greetings. Jump immediately into the friction.\n2. Readability: Flesch-Kincaid Grade 4-6 (simple, punchy, rhythmic sentences under 12 words).\n3. Body: 3 clear, practical value beats.\n4. Call To Action: Natural engagement trigger for pinned comment.\n\nOutput strict JSON with keys:\n{\n  \"hook\": \"...\",\n  \"body\": [\"...\", \"...\", \"...\"],\n  \"cta\": \"...\",\n  \"full_script\": \"...\",\n  \"youtube_meta\": { \"title\": \"...\", \"description\": \"...\", \"tags\": [\"...\"] },\n  \"tiktok_meta\": { \"caption\": \"...\", \"hashtags\": [\"#fyp\", \"...\"] },\n  \"instagram_meta\": { \"caption\": \"...\", \"hashtags\": [\"...\"] },\n  \"facebook_meta\": { \"post_text\": \"...\" }\n}",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.7,
          "maxTokens": 1500
        }
      },
      "id": "claude-omnichannel-copy",
      "name": "Claude Script & Copywriter",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [620, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/text-to-speech/21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "xi-api-key",
              "value": "={{$env.ELEVENLABS_API_KEY}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"text\": \"{{$json.full_script}}\",\n  \"model_id\": \"eleven_multilingual_v2\",\n  \"voice_settings\": {\n    \"stability\": 0.4,\n    \"similarity_boost\": 0.8\n  }\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "elevenlabs-voiceover",
      "name": "ElevenLabs Voiceover",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [860, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.shotstack.io/edit/v1/render",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-api-key",
              "value": "={{$env.SHOTSTACK_API_KEY}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"timeline\": {\n    \"soundtrack\": {\n      \"src\": \"https://assets.shotstack.io/music/ambient.mp3\",\n      \"effect\": \"fadeOut\",\n      \"volume\": 0.15\n    },\n    \"tracks\": [\n      {\n        \"clips\": [\n          {\n            \"asset\": {\n              \"type\": \"audio\",\n              \"src\": \"{{$node['ElevenLabs Voiceover'].json.audio_url}}\"\n            },\n            \"start\": 0,\n            \"length\": 45\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"output\": {\n    \"format\": \"mp4\",\n    \"resolution\": \"1080\",\n    \"aspectRatio\": \"9:16\"\n  }\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "shotstack-renderer",
      "name": "Shotstack 9:16 Cloud Render",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1100, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{$env.TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID}}",
        "text": "=🎯 *NLP-Optimized Video Ready for Review!*\n\n*Target Angle:* {{$node['NLP Frustration & Trend Analyzer'].json.thesis_angle}}\n*Trigger:* {{$node['NLP Frustration & Trend Analyzer'].json.viral_trigger}}\n*Hook:* {{$node['Claude Script & Copywriter'].json.hook}}\n\n*Video Preview:* {{$node['Shotstack 9:16 Cloud Render'].json.response.url || 'Rendering in progress'}}\n\n*Publish Targets:*\n✅ YouTube Shorts | TikTok | Instagram Reels | Facebook Reels\n\nTap to approve and trigger multi-platform distribution.",
        "replyMarkup": "inlineKeyboard",
        "inlineKeyboard": {
          "rows": [
            {
              "row": [
                {
                  "text": "🚀 Publish to All Platforms",
                  "callbackData": "publish_all"
                },
                {
                  "text": "❌ Reject / Regenerate",
                  "callbackData": "reject"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "human-review-telegram",
      "name": "Human QC Multi-Channel Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1340, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "upload",
        "title": "={{$node['Claude Script & Copywriter'].json.youtube_meta.title}}",
        "description": "={{$node['Claude Script & Copywriter'].json.youtube_meta.description}}",
        "categoryId": "27",
        "privacyStatus": "public"
      },
      "id": "youtube-upload",
      "name": "YouTube Shorts Publish",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.youTube",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1600, 160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://open.tiktokapis.com/v2/post/publish/video/init/",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{$env.TIKTOK_ACCESS_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"post_info\": {\n    \"title\": \"{{$node['Claude Script & Copywriter'].json.tiktok_meta.caption}}\",\n    \"privacy_level\": \"PUBLIC_TO_EVERYONE\"\n  },\n  \"source_info\": {\n    \"source\": \"PULL_FROM_URL\",\n    \"video_url\": \"{{$node['Shotstack 9:16 Cloud Render'].json.response.url}}\"\n  }\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "tiktok-upload",
      "name": "TikTok Direct Post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1600, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v19.0/{{$env.IG_USER_ID}}/media",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{$env.META_ACCESS_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"media_type\": \"REELS\",\n  \"video_url\": \"{{$node['Shotstack 9:16 Cloud Render'].json.response.url}}\",\n  \"caption\": \"{{$node['Claude Script & Copywriter'].json.instagram_meta.caption}}\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "instagram-reels-upload",
      "name": "Instagram Reels Post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1600, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v19.0/{{$env.FB_PAGE_ID}}/video_reels",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{$env.META_ACCESS_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"upload_phase\": \"start\",\n  \"description\": \"{{$node['Claude Script & Copywriter'].json.facebook_meta.post_text}}\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "facebook-reels-upload",
      "name": "Facebook Reels Post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1600, 580]
    }
  ],
